                "i18n": "mv2.gov.constitution",
                "text": "A universal, inheritable engineering rulebook, distributed as a Git submodule across a 140+-repository fleet. It codifies anti-bluff evidence gates, false-positive immunity, data/host safety, and coverage rules; projects may tighten but never weaken it, and each governance gate is paired with a mutation test that proves the gate itself works."
